{"sections":[{"slug":"本原单位根","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"本原单位根"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">本原单位根</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"本原单位根"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对正整数</span> $n$, <span lang=\"zh\">含幺交换环</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">本原单位根</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是满足如下条件的元素</span> $\\zeta \\in R$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\zeta^n = 1$;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对任意正整数</span> $k &lt; n$, $\\zeta^k \\neq 1$.</li>\n</ul>\n"}}}]}